Loci extracts the general desktop agent interface, removes coding-specific
features and upstream services, and uses its own branding and data storage.

Loci is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the makers of the
agent harnesses it can drive. Provider marks are trademarks of their
respective owners and are used only to identify those products.

Loci ships the official Excalidraw MCP server unmodified in
src-tauri/resources/excalidraw-mcp/official (MIT; origin, version and file
hashes are recorded in the SOURCE file beside it). Excalidraw is a trademark
of its owners and is used only to identify that project.

Loci's color themes, their wallpapers and the mapping that colors code come from
Omarchy (https://github.com/omacom/omarchy, branch quattro, commit
b83d3df0840504299d3099ebf391eb8110527edd), released under the MIT License,
Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson. The palettes and the syntax mapping are
in src/features/settings/model/omarchyThemes.generated.ts. The wallpapers,
resized and re-encoded as WebP, are in public/themes next to a copy of Omarchy's
license; the Omarchy repository does not record who made each image. Loci is not
affiliated with Omarchy.
